<title>ITALY: Bulgari buys Singapore franchising firm.</title>
<headline>Bulgari buys Singapore franchising firm.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian luxury goods group Bulgari said it has signed a 2.2 billion lire contract to acquire from from Singapore's Ong group 51 percent of Mogems Pte Ltd, the company which manages the franchising of Bulgari's three shops in Singapore.</p>
<p>The company, which will take the name of Bulgari South Asian Operations, will run Bulgari's distribution network in the South Pacific and Australia.</p>
<p>The acquisition, to be carried out by Bulgari's Bulgari Asia Ltd subsidiary, will be concluded by September, Bulgari said in a statement.</p>
<p>    mw   -- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
